<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;DR. EDUARDO SOMMELLA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Eduardo Sommella is a pharmaceutical chemist known for his work on innovative treatments for rare diseases and cancer, and his contributions to the University of Navarre and University of Naples Federico II."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF NAVARRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Navarre is an institution with a rich history and commitment to Catholic values, providing cutting-edge facilities and esteemed faculty for research and education."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF NAPLES FEDERICO II&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Naples Federico II is a prestigious institution where Dr. Eduardo Sommella held a position, contributing significantly to the field of pharmaceutical chemistry and supervising graduate students."&lt;SEP&gt;"University of Naples Federico II is an educational institution where Eduardo Sommella has collaborated with colleagues to publish research papers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PAMPLONA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pamplona is a city where Dr. Eduardo Sommella is based, known for its historic streets and the University of Navarre."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. MARÍA RODRÍGUEZ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. María Rodríguez is a colleague of Dr. Eduardo Sommella, involved in a collaborative project focused on a novel compound for cancer treatment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOURNAL OF MEDICINAL CHEMISTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Journal of Medicinal Chemistry is a scientific journal where a research paper co-authored by Dr. Eduardo Sommella was published."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROFESSOR MARIA ROSSI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Professor Maria Rossi is the Dean of the Faculty of Pharmacy at the University of Naples Federico II, praising Dr. Eduardo Sommella's contributions to the institution."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. GIOVANNI DE SANTO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Giovanni De Santo is a colleague and collaborator of Dr. Eduardo Sommella, highlighting his impact on the field of pharmaceutical chemistry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ITALIAN MINISTRY OF EDUCATION, UNIVERSITY AND RESEARCH (MIUR)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Italian Ministry of Education, University and Research (MIUR) provided funding for Dr. Eduardo Sommella's research group."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EUROPEAN UNION'S HORIZON 2020 PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The European Union's Horizon 2020 program also funded Dr. Eduardo Sommella's research group."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROLLING HILLS OF PAMPLONA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The rolling hills of Pamplona are the setting where Dr. Eduardo Sommella makes his way through the historic streets of the city."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HISTORIC STREETS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The historic streets of Pamplona are the setting where Dr. Eduardo Sommella walks, known for their charm and cultural significance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAFÉ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A café on the corner of the historic streets of Pamplona is mentioned as a place where Dr. Eduardo Sommella might stop for a moment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRAND ATRIUM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The grand atrium of the University of Navarre is where Dr. Eduardo Sommella enters and finds a soft murmur of students and professors."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHAPEL BELL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The chapel bell occasionally chimes, adding to the atmosphere of the University of Navarre."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOUNTAIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A fountain is mentioned as a gathering spot for students, where Dr. Eduardo Sommella spots a young woman with a bright smile."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;YOUNG WOMAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A young woman with a bright smile and an unmistakable air of curiosity is noticed by Dr. Eduardo Sommella, reminding him of his own passion for discovery."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LABORATORIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Adjacent laboratories create a soothing background melody with the soft rustle of papers and the hum of machinery, where Dr. Eduardo Sommella feels at home."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FAÇADE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The imposing stone façade of the University of Navarre, with its Gothic spires, is a prominent feature of the setting."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FAITH AND SCIENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Eduardo Sommella is drawn to the intersection of faith and science, making the University of Navarre a beacon for him."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EDUARDO SOMMELLA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Eduardo Sommella is a researcher who has published multiple research papers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESEARCH PAPERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Research Papers are publications resulting from collaborative efforts between Eduardo Sommella and colleagues from the University of Naples Federico II."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0245</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;DR. EDUARDO SOMMELLA&quot;" target="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF NAVARRE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dr. Eduardo Sommella is a member of the University of Navarre, conducting research and teaching there."</data>
      <data key="d5">"research, teaching"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0245</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DR. EDUARDO SOMMELLA&quot;" target="&quot;DR. MARÍA RODRÍGUEZ&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
